.TH "BASIC_CONV" 1 "" ""
.nh
.ad l
.SH Name
foo \- do something
.SH Synopsis
.nf
\fBfoo\fP [\fB\-h\fP|\fB\-\-help\fP] [\fIfile\fP...]
.fi
.SH Description
\fBfoo\fP does something, but we don't really know \fIwhat\fP\&.
.IP \& 7n
Indent me.
.IP \& 7n
Me also.
.IP \(bu 2n
List item A.
.IP \(bu 2n
List item B.
.IP (1) 7n
Numbered list item A.
.IP (2) 7n
Numbered list item B.
.SH Options
.TP 7n
\fB\-h\fP, \fB\-\-help\fP
Prints help text and exits.
.TP 7n
\fIfile\fP
Input file.
.SS Subheading 1
First subheading.
.SS Subheading 2
Second subheading.
.SH Exit status
0 on success, non\-zero on error.
